# S.H.I.E.L.D. Flying Car: "When this Vehicle enters, exile up to one target creature you control. Return that card to the
# battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step" (CR 603.7). {2}{U} is paid exactly by Black
# Lotus's {U}{U}{U}. The Car itself is not a creature (a Vehicle), so it is no candidate, and Bot1's Ornithopter is exiled
# for the rest of turn 1 and is back, a new object, in turn 2. The Car is a 3/3 artifact with flash and flying.

